Edge (CDN, WAF, gateway with JWT checks and rate limits), discovery services (catalog, search, pricing, promotions, recommendations), a transaction layer in cells (cart, checkout saga, inventory, slots, payments, orders), an event backbone (outbox, then Kafka) feeding fulfilment, dispatch,

